Art. 123 Electronic procedures
(Art. 65a VAT Act)
1 If the electronic procedure is mandatory, all submissions to the FTA must be made electronically via the portal provided for this purpose.
2 The electronic procedure is mandatory for:
a. …
b. annual reporting (Art. 35a and 86a VAT Act);
c. …
d. …
e. registration as a taxable person (Art. 66 para. 1 VAT Act);
f. …
g. filing returns (Art. 71 VAT Act);
h. correction of errors in returns (Art. 72 VAT Act).
|

